#. Key:	JeongwooSorry
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(11275)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(11275)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,JeongwooSorry"
msgid "어, 어제 골목에서… 진짜 죄송했어요. 많이 놀라셨죠."
msgstr "Oh, about yesterday in the alley… I’m really sorry. That must’ve given you a scare."

#. Key:	YudamToJeongwoo
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(11277)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(11277)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamToJeongwoo"
msgid "괜찮아요. 저도 앞을 잘 안 봤어요."
msgstr "It’s fine. I wasn’t really watching where I was going either."

#. Key:	JeongwooIntro
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(11278)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(11278)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,JeongwooIntro"
msgid "저 202호 살아요, 정우예요. 새벽에 오토바이 소리 나면 저예요. 죄송해요."
msgstr "I live in 202. I’m Jeongwoo. If you hear a motorbike before dawn, that’s me. Sorry about that."

#. Key:	JeongwooGuest1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(11284)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(11284)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,JeongwooGuest1"
msgid "새벽에 콜 받고 나가려는데, 누가 문을 두드리면서 제 이름을 부르더라고요. 엄마 목소리로요."
msgstr "I was heading out for an order before dawn, and someone knocked on my door, calling my name. In my mom’s voice."

#. Key:	JeongwooGuest2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(11288)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(11288)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,JeongwooGuest2"
msgid "저희 엄마 대구 계시거든요. 안 열었어요."
msgstr "My mom lives in Daegu. I didn’t open it."

#. Key:	JeongwooGuest3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(11289)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGListenerGreyboxDirector.cpp(11289)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,JeongwooGuest3"
msgid "동네장터에도 올렸어요. 403호도 걸쇠 꼭 거세요."
msgstr "I put it up on Neighborhood Market too. Make sure you do up your latch in 403."

#. Key:	JeongwooLatchAgain
