#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(807)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(807)
