msgstr "I pass 401, where the water bowl used to be. There’s a small radio on the windowsill."

#. Key:	EpilogueAutumn2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(832)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(832)
