msgstr "She’s turned the radio to face outside. You’d hear it down in the alley."

#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(861)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(861)
