#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(879)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(879)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay3Seen"
