#. Key:	EpilogueServiceBay4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(885)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(885)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueServiceBay4"
msgid "방을 빼고 403호 열쇠를 돌려줬다."
msgstr "I moved out and gave back the key to 403."

#. Key:	EpilogueDoorNote1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(896)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(896)
