msgstr "The old notes have all been taken down. One new pale blue note is taped in their place."

#. Key:	EpilogueDoorNote2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(900)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(900)
