#. Key:	EpilogueNews3Seen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(936)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorEpilogueDirector.cpp(936)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,EpilogueNews3Seen"
