msgstr "To the Building Manager"

#. Key:	Forum1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(918)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(918)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Forum1"
msgid "6/30  새벽 네 시만 되면 위에서 뭘 질질 끕니다. 자다가 매번 깨요."
msgstr "6/30  Every night at 4 a.m., something gets dragged around upstairs. It wakes me up every time."

#. Key:	Forum2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(919)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(919)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Forum2"
msgid "7/12  관리인은 창고라 사람이 없대요. 그럼 이 소리는 어디서 나는 건가요?"
msgstr "7/12  The manager says it’s storage and nobody’s up there. Then where’s this noise coming from?"

#. Key:	Forum3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(921)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(921)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Forum3"
msgid "7/26  03:12  어차피 네 시면 또 시작이에요. 오늘은 올라가 봅니다. 사람인지 뭔지 얼굴이나 보죠."
msgstr "7/26  03:12  It’ll start again at four anyway. I’m going up there today. Person or whatever, I’m at least going to see a face."

#. Key:	Forum4
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(922)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(922)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,Forum4"
msgid "댓글 12  ·  참지 마세요 / 잘 생각하셨어요 / 가서 확실하게 말하세요"
msgstr "12 comments  ·  Don’t put up with it / Good call / Go up and tell them straight"

#. Key:	JournalPrompt
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(949)
#: Source/IndieGame/Entity/IGMissingFloorNightThreeDirector.cpp(949)
