#. Key:	NightTwo3Carbon
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(100)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(100)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo3Carbon"
msgid "연필로 접수철 밑장을 끝까지 문질러 보자."
msgstr "I’ll rub a pencil over the whole sheet underneath on the intake pad."

#. Key:	NightTwo3Agent
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(102)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(102)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo3Agent"
msgid "책상에 부동산 문자 출력본이 있었어. 그것도 읽어 보자."
msgstr "There was a printout of the realtor’s texts on the desk. I should read that too."

#. Key:	NightTwo3Desk
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(103)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(103)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo3Desk"
msgid "관리실 책상을 한 번 더 둘러보자."
msgstr "I’ll check the management office desk again."

#. Key:	NightTwo1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(105)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(105)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo1"
msgid "소리 민원이 들어갔다면 관리실에 기록이 남았겠지."
msgstr "Any noise complaints would be on record at the management office."

#. Key:	NightTwo2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(106)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(106)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwo2"
msgid "민원 대장이 너무 깨끗해. 접수철은 윗장이 뜯겼던데, 밑장에 눌린 자국이 남았을지도."
msgstr "The complaint ledger’s too clean. The intake pad’s top sheet is torn off, but the sheet underneath might still have pen marks."

#. Key:	NightTwoRevisit1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(115)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(115)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoRevisit1"
msgid "어젯밤엔 403호까지 못 돌아왔어."
msgstr "I didn’t make it back to 403 last night."

#. Key:	NightTwoRevisit2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(116)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(116)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoRevisit2"
msgid "1층 관리실에 다시 들렀다가 403호로 돌아오자."
msgstr "I’ll stop by the management office downstairs, then go back to 403."

#. Key:	NightTwoReturn1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(120)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(120)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoReturn1"
msgid "이제 403호로 돌아가야 해."
msgstr "I need to get back to 403 now."

#. Key:	NightTwoReturn2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(121)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(121)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoReturn2"
msgid "계단으로 올라가서 403호 안까지. 발소리를 줄이자."
msgstr "Up the stairs and all the way inside 403. I’ll keep my footsteps quiet."

#. Key:	NightTwoReturn3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(122)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(122)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightTwoReturn3"
msgid "쫓아오면 뛰어서라도 403호 안으로 들어가자."
msgstr "If he comes after me, I’ll run for it. Just get inside 403."

#. Key:	NightThreeReturn1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(134)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(134)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeReturn1"
msgid "이제 403호로 돌아가자."
msgstr "Time to go back to 403."

#. Key:	NightThreeReturn2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(135)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(135)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeReturn2"
msgid "아까 그 박자로 두드리니까 멈췄어. 복도에서도 통할까."
msgstr "It stopped when I knocked that rhythm before. Would it work in the corridor too?"

#. Key:	NightThreeReturn3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(136)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(136)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeReturn3"
msgid "복도에서 둘, 쉬고, 하나로 두드리고, 멈춘 사이에 403호로 들어가자."
msgstr "I’ll knock two, pause, one in the hallway and get into 403 while he’s stopped."

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(147)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(147)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm1"
msgid "오빠가 문 두드리던 박자가 있었는데."
msgstr "My brother had a way of knocking on doors."

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(148)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(148)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm2"
msgid "음성 메시지에서 그랬잖아. “문 두드리면 알지? 둘, 하나.”"
msgstr "He said it in the voicemail. “You know my knock, right? Two, then one.”"

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm3Notebook
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(150)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(150)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm3Notebook"
msgid "조율 수첩에도 그 박자가 적혀 있었을 거야. 수첩부터 다시 보자."
msgstr "The rhythm’s probably in his tuning notebook too. I’ll check the notebook again first."

#. Key:	NightThreeRhythm3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(151)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(151)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeRhythm3"
msgid "둘, 쉬고, 하나. 그 박자로 비어 있는 벽을 두드려 보자."
msgstr "Two, pause, one. I’ll knock that rhythm on the hollow wall."

#. Key:	NightThreeKey1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(159)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(159)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeKey1"
msgid "옥상 문을 열 열쇠가 있어야 해."
msgstr "I need a key to open the roof door."

#. Key:	NightThreeKey2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(160)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(160)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeKey2"
msgid "관리실 책상 위에 열쇠 꾸러미가 있었지."
msgstr "There was a key ring on the management office desk."

#. Key:	NightThreeKey3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(161)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(161)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeKey3"
msgid "1층 관리실에서 열쇠 꾸러미를 챙겨서 옥상으로 올라가자."
msgstr "I’ll grab the key ring from the first-floor office and head up to the roof."

#. Key:	NightThreeDoor1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(169)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(169)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeDoor1"
msgid "옥상 너머에 문이 하나 더 있을 거야."
msgstr "There should be another door across the roof."

#. Key:	NightThreeDoor2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(170)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(170)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeDoor2"
msgid "옥상 물탱크 옆으로 가면 철문이 있어."
msgstr "There’s a steel door past the water tank on the roof."

#. Key:	NightThreeDoor3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(171)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(171)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeDoor3"
msgid "열쇠 꾸러미의 다른 열쇠로 5층 철문을 열자."
msgstr "The other key on the key ring should open the fifth-floor door."

#. Key:	NightThreeWall1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(174)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(174)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall1"
msgid "벽 세 칸 중에 하나는 속이 비어 있을 거야."
msgstr "One of the three wall sections must be hollow."

#. Key:	NightThreeWall2Criterion
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(176)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(176)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall2Criterion"
msgid "수첩에 적혀 있었지. 빈 곳은 낮게 울리고 소리가 오래 간다고."
msgstr "It was in the notebook. Hollow spots ring low and the sound lingers."

#. Key:	NightThreeWall2Notebook
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(177)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(177)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall2Notebook"
msgid "조율 수첩에 벽 얘기가 있었을 거야. 그것부터 읽자."
msgstr "The tuning notebook probably mentions the walls. I’ll read that first."

#. Key:	NightThreeWall3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(178)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(178)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightThreeWall3"
msgid "배관 밸브를 열고 벽마다 귀를 대 보자. 아니면 하나씩 두드려서 어디가 오래 울리는지 들어 보자."
msgstr "I’ll open the pipe valve and listen at each wall. Or knock on each one and listen for which rings longest."

#. Key:	NightFour3Drain
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(186)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(186)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour3Drain"
msgid "옥상 저수조의 세척 배수 밸브부터 열자."
msgstr "First, I’ll open the drain valve on the roof water tank."

#. Key:	NightFour3Bypass
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(188)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(188)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour3Bypass"
msgid "다음은 옥상 우회 밸브야."
msgstr "Next, the bypass valve on the roof."

#. Key:	NightFour3Pump
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(189)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(189)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour3Pump"
msgid "마지막으로 1층 관리실의 이송 펌프를 수동으로 돌리자."
msgstr "Last, I’ll run the transfer pump in the first-floor management office by hand."

#. Key:	NightFour1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(191)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(191)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour1"
msgid "벽을 치려면 그 소리를 덮을 게 있어야 해."
msgstr "To hit the wall, I need something to cover the sound."

#. Key:	NightFour2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(192)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(192)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFour2"
msgid "탱크를 청소하는 새벽엔 배관이 온 벽을 울린다고 했지. 저수조 점검 메모에 순서가 있었어."
msgstr "Supposedly the pipes shake every wall when they clean the tank before dawn. The tank inspection notes had the steps."

#. Key:	NightFourWall1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(198)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(198)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall1"
msgid "물소리가 나는 동안 벽을 쳐야 해."
msgstr "I have to hit the wall while the water’s running."

#. Key:	NightFourWall2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(199)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(199)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall2"
msgid "낮에 사 온 망치가 있잖아. 5층 벽 앞으로 가자."
msgstr "I’ve got the hammer I bought today. Now to the fifth-floor wall."

#. Key:	NightFourWall3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(200)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(200)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourWall3"
msgid "물소리가 날 때 5층 가운데 벽을 망치로 치자. 구멍이 날 때까지."
msgstr "While the water runs, I’ll take the hammer to the middle wall on the fifth floor until it gives."

#. Key:	NightFourReveal1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(205)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(205)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourReveal1"
msgid "벽 안을 봐야 해."
msgstr "I need to look inside."

#. Key:	NightFourReveal2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(206)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(206)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourReveal2"
msgid "손전등으로 벽 안쪽을 비춰 보자."
msgstr "Shine the flashlight into the wall."

#. Key:	NightFourChoice1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(209)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(209)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourChoice1"
msgid "오빠 곁에 가 보자."
msgstr "Go over to him."

#. Key:	NightFourChoice2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(210)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(210)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightFourChoice2"
msgid "튜닝 해머를 오빠 곁에 두고 물러나거나, 녹음을 끄고 곁에 앉아 있거나."
msgstr "Leave the tuning hammer beside my brother and step back, or stop recording and sit with him."

#. Key:	DayOne1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(221)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(221)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOne1"
msgid "401호 할머니는 이 건물에 오래 사셨잖아."
msgstr "Mrs. Hwang in 401 has lived in this building a long time."

#. Key:	DayOne2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(222)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(222)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOne2"
msgid "401호 문을 두드려서 여쭤보자."
msgstr "I’ll knock on 401’s door and ask her."

#. Key:	DayOne3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(223)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(223)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOne3"
msgid "밤에는 1층 관리실. 민원 대장부터 보자."
msgstr "Tonight, the first-floor office. Complaint ledger first."

#. Key:	DayOneMissed1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(225)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(225)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOneMissed1"
msgid "어젯밤엔 아무것도 못 알아냈어."
msgstr "I didn’t find out anything last night."

#. Key:	DayOneMissed2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(226)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(226)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOneMissed2"
msgid "401호 할머니께 여쭤보자."
msgstr "I’ll go ask Mrs. Hwang in 401."

#. Key:	DayOneMissed3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(227)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(227)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOneMissed3"
msgid "밤이 오면 1층 계량기함부터 보자."
msgstr "Tonight, I’ll check the lobby meter box first."

#. Key:	DayTwo1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(231)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(231)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayTwo1"
msgid "할머니께 또 여쭤볼까."
msgstr "Should I ask Mrs. Hwang again?"

#. Key:	DayTwo2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(232)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(232)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayTwo2"
msgid "401호 문을 두드려 보자."
msgstr "I’ll knock on 401’s door."

#. Key:	DayTwo3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(233)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(233)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayTwo3"
msgid "관리실 책상 위에 열쇠 꾸러미가 있었어. 그걸로 옥상 문을 열 수 있겠다."
msgstr "There was a key ring on the management office desk. That should open the roof door."

#. Key:	DayTwoMissed1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(235)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(235)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayTwoMissed1"
msgid "어젯밤엔 403호까지 못 돌아왔어."
msgstr "I didn’t make it back to 403 last night."

#. Key:	DayTwoMissed2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(236)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(236)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayTwoMissed2"
msgid "401호 할머니께 여쭤보자."
msgstr "I’ll go ask Mrs. Hwang in 401."

#. Key:	DayTwoMissed3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(237)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(237)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayTwoMissed3"
msgid "밤이 되면 관리실에 들렀다가 403호로 돌아오자."
msgstr "Tonight, I’ll stop by the management office, then come back to 403."

#. Key:	DayThreeNotice1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(243)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(243)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThreeNotice1"
msgid "문에 종이가 붙어 있던데."
msgstr "Something was taped to my door."

#. Key:	DayThreeNotice2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(244)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(244)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThreeNotice2"
msgid "403호 문에 붙은 퇴거 통보문을 읽어 보자."
msgstr "I’ll read the eviction notice on 403’s door."

#. Key:	DayThree1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(248)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(248)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThree1"
msgid "할머니께 말씀드려야겠어."
msgstr "I should tell Mrs. Hwang."

#. Key:	DayThree2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(249)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(249)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThree2"
msgid "401호 문을 두드려 보자."
msgstr "I’ll knock on 401’s door."

#. Key:	DayThree3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(250)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(250)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThree3"
msgid "할 일을 다 했으면 403호에 가서 자자."
msgstr "Once I’ve done what I need to, I’ll go to bed in 403."

#. Key:	DayThreeMissed1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(252)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(252)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThreeMissed1"
msgid "어젯밤엔 끝까지 못 갔어."
msgstr "I didn’t get far enough last night."

#. Key:	DayThreeMissed2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(253)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(253)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThreeMissed2"
msgid "401호 할머니께 여쭤보자."
msgstr "I’ll go ask Mrs. Hwang in 401."

#. Key:	DayThreeMissed3
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(254)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(254)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayThreeMissed3"
msgid "밤이 되면 5층 벽 앞까지 다시 가 보자."
msgstr "Tonight, I’ll try to reach the fifth-floor wall again."

#. Key:	DayOther1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(257)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(257)
msgctxt "IGHint,DayOther1"
msgid "401호 할머니께 여쭤보자."
msgstr "I’ll go ask Mrs. Hwang in 401."

#. Key:	ArrivalContract1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(37)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(37)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalContract1"
msgid "책상 위에 계약서를 뒀지. 한번 읽어 보자."
msgstr "There was a lease on the desk. I should read it properly."

#. Key:	ArrivalContract2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(38)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(38)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalContract2"
msgid "403호 책상 위 임대차계약서. 그것부터 보자."
msgstr "The lease on the desk in 403. I’ll start with that."

#. Key:	ArrivalBoxes1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(45)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(45)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalBoxes1"
msgid "짐을 아직 다 안 풀었네."
msgstr "I still haven’t finished unpacking."

#. Key:	ArrivalBoxes2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(46)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(46)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalBoxes2"
msgid "택배 상자, 공구 상자, 예전 휴대폰 상자. 셋 다 열어 보자."
msgstr "The returned box, the box of tuning tools, the box with my old phone. I’ll open all three."

#. Key:	ArrivalStore1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(51)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(51)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalStore1"
msgid "편의점에 사진 한번 보여 드릴까."
msgstr "Maybe the shop clerk will recognize his photo."

#. Key:	ArrivalStore2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(52)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(52)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalStore2"
msgid "1층으로 내려가서 골목으로 나가 보자. 편의점 계산대에 호출벨이 있을 거야."
msgstr "I’ll head downstairs and out to the alley. The convenience store counter should have a bell."

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighbors1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(59)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(59)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighbors1"
msgid "옆집에는 아직 인사도 못 했네."
msgstr "I haven’t even said hi to the neighbors."

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighborsBoth
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(61)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(61)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighborsBoth"
msgid "401호는 문을 두드려 보고, 402호는 문에 붙은 메모를 읽어 보자."
msgstr "I’ll knock on 401’s door and read the note on 402’s."

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighbors401
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(63)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(63)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighbors401"
msgid "401호 문을 두드려 보자. 누가 사는지는 알아야지."
msgstr "I’ll knock on 401’s door. I should know who lives there."

#. Key:	ArrivalNeighbors402
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(64)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(64)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalNeighbors402"
msgid "402호 문에 붙은 메모를 아직 안 읽었네."
msgstr "I still haven’t read the note on 402’s door."

#. Key:	ArrivalRoof1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(69)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(69)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalRoof1"
msgid "계약서에 옥상 얘기가 있었는데."
msgstr "The lease said something about the roof."

#. Key:	ArrivalRoof2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(70)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(70)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalRoof2"
msgid "계단 끝까지 올라가서 옥상 문을 확인해 보자."
msgstr "I’ll go all the way up the stairs and check the roof door."

#. Key:	ArrivalSleep1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(73)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(73)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalSleep1"
msgid "오늘은 이만 자자."
msgstr "Time to call it a night."

#. Key:	ArrivalSleep2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(74)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(74)
msgctxt "IGHint,ArrivalSleep2"
msgid "403호 침대에 눕자. 알람은 네 시 반에 맞춰 뒀어."
msgstr "I’ll get into bed in 403. The alarm’s set for 4:30 a.m."

#. Key:	NightOne3Dial
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(83)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(83)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne3Dial"
msgid "복도등을 끄고, 이름표 없는 차단기를 내렸다 올리면서 다섯 번째 원판을 보자."
msgstr "I’ll turn off the hallway lights, then flip the unlabeled breaker down and up and watch the fifth meter disc."

#. Key:	NightOne3Sheet
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(85)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(85)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne3Sheet"
msgid "검침 기록지도 읽어 봐야 해. 마지막 칸이 이상했어."
msgstr "I need to read the meter reading log too. The last row looked wrong."

#. Key:	NightOne3Breaker
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(86)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(86)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne3Breaker"
msgid "이름표 없는 차단기를 올려 둔 채로 원판을 한 번 더 보자."
msgstr "I’ll leave the unlabeled breaker up and look at the meter disc again."

#. Key:	NightOne1
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(88)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(88)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne1"
msgid "위에 누가 있으면 전기를 쓰겠지. 1층 계량기함을 봐야겠다."
msgstr "If someone’s up there, they’d be using power. I should check the lobby meter box."

#. Key:	NightOne2
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(89)
#: Source/IndieGame/Narrative/IGMissingFloorHints.cpp(89)
msgctxt "IGHint,NightOne2"
msgid "이름 없는 계량기가 하나 더 있었지. 복도등을 꺼도 돌아가면 다른 데 전기가 들어가는 거야."
msgstr "There was an extra meter with no label. If it keeps turning with the hallway lights off, it must be powering something else."

#. Key:	YudamBatteryChanged
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGFlashlightComponent.cpp(174)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGFlashlightComponent.cpp(174)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamBatteryChanged"
msgid "건전지를 새것으로 갈아 끼웠다."
msgstr "Swapped in fresh batteries."

#. Key:	YudamFlashlightLowSpare
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGFlashlightComponent.cpp(314)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGFlashlightComponent.cpp(314)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamFlashlightLowSpare"
msgid "불빛이 약해졌어. 잠깐 끄고 건전지를 갈자."
msgstr "The light's getting weak. I'll switch it off and change the batteries."

#. Key:	YudamFlashlightLow
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGFlashlightComponent.cpp(315)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGFlashlightComponent.cpp(315)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamFlashlightLow"
msgid "불빛이 약해졌어. 건전지가 다 돼 가나 봐."
msgstr "The light's getting weak. Batteries must be running out."

#. Key:	SoundBearingAbove
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(1329)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(1329)
msgctxt "IGHUD,SoundBearingAbove"
msgid "위"
msgstr "above"

#. Key:	SoundBearingBelow
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(1330)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(1330)
msgctxt "IGHUD,SoundBearingBelow"
msgid "아래"
msgstr "below"

#. Key:	SoundBearingBehind
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(1343)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(1343)
msgctxt "IGHUD,SoundBearingBehind"
msgid "뒤"
msgstr "behind"

#. Key:	SoundBearingRight
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(1346)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(1346)
msgctxt "IGHUD,SoundBearingRight"
msgid "오른쪽"
msgstr "right"

#. Key:	SoundBearingLeft
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(1347)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(1347)
msgctxt "IGHUD,SoundBearingLeft"
msgid "왼쪽"
