msgstr "Press again to reset"

#. Key:	A11yHintsDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5559)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5559)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yHintsDesc"
msgid "힌트 키를 누를 때마다 지금 어디를 보면 되는지 조금씩 더 자세히 알려 줍니다. 끄면 힌트 키를 눌러도 아무 일도 일어나지 않습니다."
msgstr "Each press of the hint key gives a little more detail about where to look. When off, the hint key does nothing."

#. Key:	A11yReducedMotionDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5560)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5560)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yReducedMotionDesc"
msgid "걷거나 쫓길 때 화면이 덜 흔들리게 합니다."
msgstr "Reduces camera shake while you walk or are being chased."

#. Key:	A11yReducedFlickerDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5561)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5561)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yReducedFlickerDesc"
msgid "손전등과 조명이 빠르게 깜빡이는 효과를 줄입니다."
msgstr "Reduces rapid flickering from the flashlight and other lights."

#. Key:	A11yFieldOfViewDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5562)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5562)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yFieldOfViewDesc"
msgid "한 화면에 보이는 범위를 조절합니다. 화면이 답답하거나 어지럽다면 편한 값으로 맞춰 보세요."
msgstr "Changes how much you can see at once. If the view feels cramped or makes you dizzy, set it to whatever feels comfortable."

#. Key:	A11yVignetteDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5563)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5563)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yVignetteDesc"
msgid "화면 가장자리를 어둡게 합니다. 움직일 때 주변 풍경이 덜 보이게 할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Darkens the edges of the screen, so less of your surroundings is visible while you move."

#. Key:	A11yCameraTextureDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5564)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5564)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCameraTextureDesc"
msgid "화면 가장자리에 약한 렌즈 왜곡 효과를 더합니다. 눈이 피로하면 낮춰 주세요."
msgstr "Adds subtle lens distortion around the edges. Turn it down if your eyes get tired."

#. Key:	A11yCenterDotDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5565)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5565)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCenterDotDesc"
msgid "평소에는 조사할 물건을 겨눌 때만 화면 가운데에 점이 뜹니다. 어지럽다면 항상 띄워 두세요. 화면을 볼 때 기준점이 됩니다."
msgstr "By default, a dot appears in the center of the screen only when you aim at something to examine. If you feel dizzy, set it to Always. It gives your eyes a fixed point."

#. Key:	A11yFearDirectionDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5566)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5566)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yFearDirectionDesc"
msgid "중요한 소리가 나면 화면 가장자리에 그 방향을 표시합니다."
msgstr "Shows the direction of important sounds at the edge of the screen."

#. Key:	A11yKnockRingDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5567)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5567)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yKnockRingDesc"
msgid "위층 사람이 낸 소리는 얇은 원으로, 내가 낸 소리는 굵은 원으로 표시합니다."
msgstr "Sounds from the one upstairs appear as thin rings. Sounds you make appear as thick rings."

#. Key:	A11yKnockHapticDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5568)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5568)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yKnockHapticDesc"
msgid "위층 사람이 소리를 내면 게임패드가 진동합니다. 멀리서 나는 소리일수록 진동도 약해집니다."
msgstr "The gamepad vibrates when the one upstairs makes a sound. More distant sounds produce weaker vibrations."

#. Key:	A11yHeartbeatDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5569)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5569)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yHeartbeatDesc"
msgid "긴장했을 때 화면 가장자리가 심장 박동에 맞춰 움직입니다."
msgstr "When you’re tense, the edges of the screen pulse with your heartbeat."

#. Key:	A11yKnockAssistDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5570)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5570)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yKnockAssistDesc"
msgid "박자가 조금 늦거나 빨라도 맞은 것으로 칩니다."
msgstr "Knocks still count if your timing is a little early or late."

#. Key:	A11ySoundCaptionsDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5571)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5571)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11ySoundCaptionsDesc"
msgid "두드리는 소리나 발소리처럼 진행에 필요한 소리를 글로 보여 줍니다."
msgstr "Shows the sounds that matter, like knocks and footsteps, as text."

#. Key:	A11yCaptionSizeDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5572)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5572)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCaptionSizeDesc"
msgid "대화와 소리 자막의 글자 크기를 함께 바꿉니다. 아래에서 미리 볼 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Changes the text size of both dialogue and sound captions. You can preview it below."

#. Key:	A11yCaptionBackgroundDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5573)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5573)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCaptionBackgroundDesc"
msgid "자막 뒤의 검은 배경을 얼마나 진하게 표시할지 정합니다."
msgstr "Sets how dark the background behind captions is."

#. Key:	A11yCaptionSafeAreaDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5574)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5574)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCaptionSafeAreaDesc"
msgid "값을 줄이면 자막이 화면 안쪽에 표시됩니다."
msgstr "Lower values move captions in from the edges of the screen."

#. Key:	A11yCaptionDurationDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5575)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5575)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCaptionDurationDesc"
msgid "자막이 사라지는 시간을 조절합니다. 읽을 시간이 부족하면 값을 높여 주세요."
msgstr "Changes how long captions stay on screen. Raise it if you need more time to read."

#. Key:	A11yCrouchInputDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5576)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5576)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCrouchInputDesc"
msgid "앉기 키를 한 번 눌러 전환하거나, 누르고 있는 동안만 유지하도록 선택합니다."
msgstr "Choose whether one press toggles crouching, or you crouch only while holding the key."

#. Key:	A11yHoldInputDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5577)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5577)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yHoldInputDesc"
msgid "상호작용을 길게 누르는 대신 한 번 눌러 시작하고 다시 눌러 취소할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Instead of holding the button for interactions, press once to start and press again to cancel."

#. Key:	A11yHoldDurationDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5578)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5578)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yHoldDurationDesc"
msgid "문을 열거나 조사할 때 버튼을 얼마나 오래 누를지 정합니다."
msgstr "Sets how long you hold the button to open doors or examine things."

#. Key:	A11yPromptKeysDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5579)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5579)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yPromptKeysDesc"
msgid "항상으로 두면 조사 안내 앞에 누를 키를 늘 붙입니다. 익힐 때까지로 두면 같은 동작을 세 번 한 뒤부터는 키 이름을 빼고 보여 줍니다."
msgstr "Set to Always, prompts always show the key to press. Set to While Learning, the key name is dropped once you’ve done the same action three times."

#. Key:	A11yHapticsDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5580)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5580)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yHapticsDesc"
msgid "게임패드 진동을 켜거나 끕니다."
msgstr "Turns gamepad vibration on or off."

#. Key:	A11yMicrophoneDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5581)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5581)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yMicrophoneDesc"
msgid "켜면 내 목소리와 주변 소리에 위층 사람이 반응합니다. 꺼 두면 마이크를 사용하지 않습니다."
msgstr "When on, the one upstairs reacts to your voice and sounds around you. When off, the microphone isn’t used."

#. Key:	A11yResetDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5582)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5582)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yResetDesc"
msgid "이 화면의 설정을 처음 상태로 되돌립니다."
msgstr "Resets the settings on this screen to their defaults."

#. Key:	A11yCloseDesc
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5583)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGHorrorHUD.cpp(5583)
msgctxt "IGHUD,A11yCloseDesc"
msgid "설정을 저장하고 이전 화면으로 돌아갑니다."
msgstr "Saves your settings and returns to the previous screen."

