msgid "‘{0}’에서 이미 쓰는 키입니다. 그쪽을 먼저 바꿔 주세요."
msgstr "“{0}” already uses that key. Change that one first."

#. Key:	DescSprint
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(22)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(22)
msgctxt "IGInput,DescSprint"
msgid "빠르게 달립니다. 발소리와 숨소리가 커집니다."
msgstr "Run fast. Your footsteps and breathing get louder."

#. Key:	ActionCrouch
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(28)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(28)
msgctxt "IGInput,ActionCrouch"
msgid "앉기"
msgstr "Crouch"

#. Key:	DescCrouch
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(29)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(29)
msgctxt "IGInput,DescCrouch"
msgid "몸을 낮춰 조용히 움직입니다."
msgstr "Stay low and move quietly."

#. Key:	ActionInteract
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(35)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(35)
msgctxt "IGInput,ActionInteract"
msgid "조사 · 상호작용"
msgstr "Examine / Interact"

#. Key:	DescInteract
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(36)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(36)
msgctxt "IGInput,DescInteract"
msgid "물건을 조사하거나 문을 엽니다. 문은 길게 누르면 조용히 열 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Examine objects or open doors. Hold to open doors quietly."

#. Key:	ActionKnock
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(42)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(42)
msgctxt "IGInput,ActionKnock"
msgid "두드리기"
msgstr "Knock"

#. Key:	DescKnock
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(43)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(43)
msgctxt "IGInput,DescKnock"
msgid "문이나 벽을 두드립니다. 돌아오는 소리를 들어 보세요."
msgstr "Knock on doors or walls. Listen for what comes back."

#. Key:	ActionListen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(49)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(49)
msgctxt "IGInput,ActionListen"
msgid "귀 대기"
msgstr "Listen"

#. Key:	DescListen
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(50)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(50)
msgctxt "IGInput,DescListen"
msgid "벽에 귀를 대고 듣습니다. 키보드에서는 벽을 보며 조사 키를 길게 누르세요."
msgstr "Press your ear to the wall and listen. On keyboard, face the wall and hold the Interact key."

#. Key:	ActionHoldBreath
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(56)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(56)
msgctxt "IGInput,ActionHoldBreath"
msgid "숨 참기"
msgstr "Hold Breath"

#. Key:	DescHoldBreath
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(57)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(57)
msgctxt "IGInput,DescHoldBreath"
msgid "잠깐 숨을 참습니다. 너무 오래 참으면 숨소리가 거칠어집니다."
msgstr "Hold your breath for a moment. Hold it too long and you’ll gasp for air."

#. Key:	ActionFlashlight
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(63)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(63)
msgctxt "IGInput,ActionFlashlight"
msgid "손전등"
msgstr "Flashlight"

#. Key:	DescFlashlight
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(64)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(64)
msgctxt "IGInput,DescFlashlight"
msgid "손전등을 켜거나 끕니다. 딸깍 소리도 위층 사람이 들을 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Turn the flashlight on or off. The one upstairs can hear the switch, too."

#. Key:	ActionJump
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(70)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(70)
msgctxt "IGInput,ActionJump"
msgid "점프"
msgstr "Jump"

#. Key:	DescJump
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(71)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(71)
msgctxt "IGInput,DescJump"
msgid "낮은 장애물을 뛰어넘습니다. 착지하면 소리가 납니다."
msgstr "Jump over low obstacles. Landing makes noise."

#. Key:	ActionJournal
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(77)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(77)
msgctxt "IGInput,ActionJournal"
msgid "기록 보기"
msgstr "Open Journal"

#. Key:	DescJournal
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(78)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(78)
msgctxt "IGInput,DescJournal"
msgid "낮에 그동안 찾은 단서를 다시 볼 수 있습니다."
msgstr "During the day, review the clues you’ve found so far."

#. Key:	ActionHint
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(84)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(84)
msgctxt "IGInput,ActionHint"
msgid "힌트"
msgstr "Hint"

#. Key:	DescHint
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(85)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(85)
msgctxt "IGInput,DescHint"
msgid "막혔을 때 지금 어디를 보면 될지 떠올립니다. 누를수록 조금씩 더 자세해집니다."
msgstr "When you’re stuck, Yudam thinks of where to look. Each press gets a little more specific."

#. Key:	ActionLoadAutosave
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(91)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(91)
msgctxt "IGInput,ActionLoadAutosave"
msgid "자동 저장 불러오기"
msgstr "Load Autosave"

#. Key:	DescLoadAutosave
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(92)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGInputBindingSubsystem.cpp(92)
msgctxt "IGInput,DescLoadAutosave"
msgid "최근 자동 저장부터 다시 시작합니다. 밤이 진행되는 동안에는 불러올 수 없습니다."
msgstr "Restart from the latest autosave. Not available during the night."

#. Key:	MicrophoneUnavailable
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerCharacter.cpp(1457)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerCharacter.cpp(1457)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,MicrophoneUnavailable"
msgid "[마이크 입력을 열 수 없음]"
msgstr "[couldn’t open microphone input]"

#. Key:	MicrophoneEnabled
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerCharacter.cpp(1473)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerCharacter.cpp(1473)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,MicrophoneEnabled"
msgid "[마이크 소음 입력 켜짐 · 음성은 저장되지 않음]"
msgstr "[mic noise input on · voice not saved]"

#. Key:	MissingFloorLoadLocked
