msgid "지금은 되돌릴 수 없어."
msgstr "I can’t go back now."

#. Key:	LoadingLatestAutosave
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerCharacter.cpp(2536)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerCharacter.cpp(2536)
