msgid "최근 자동 저장을 불러옵니다."
msgstr "Loading the latest autosave."

#. Key:	NoAutosaveAvailable
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerCharacter.cpp(2540)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerCharacter.cpp(2540)
