msgstr "No autosave to load."

#. Key:	NotCarried
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerCharacter.cpp(459)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerCharacter.cpp(459)
msgctxt "IGFlashlight,NotCarried"
msgid "손전등… 현관 신발장 위에 두고 왔지."
msgstr "The flashlight… I left it on the shoe cabinet."

#. Key:	YudamStandBlocked
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerCharacter.cpp(891)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerCharacter.cpp(891)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloor,YudamStandBlocked"
msgid "머리 위가 막혀서 못 일어나겠어."
msgstr "No room to stand up here."

#. Key:	DialogueLongKorean
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerController.cpp(1136)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerController.cpp(1136)
msgctxt "IGFrontendProbe,DialogueLongKorean"
msgid "통화가 연결되지 않습니다. 천장에서 두드리는 소리가 세 번 났고, 같은 순간 휴대폰 알람이 네 시 반을 알렸습니다. 이 문장은 큰 글자에서도 잘리지 않고 다음 페이지로 이어져야 합니다. 플레이어가 이동 중이어도 앞 문장을 덮어쓰지 않아야 합니다."
msgstr "The call won’t connect. Three knocks came from the ceiling, and at the same moment the phone alarm went off for 4:30 a.m. This sentence must continue onto the next page without being cut off, even at large text sizes. It must not overwrite the previous line, even while the player is moving."

#. Key:	NightDenied
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerController.cpp(2354)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerController.cpp(2354)
msgctxt "IGMissingFloorJournal,NightDenied"
msgid "지금은 그럴 때가 아니야."
msgstr "Now’s not the time."

#. Key:	LoadLockedAtNight
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerController.cpp(2966)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerController.cpp(2966)
