msgstr "You can’t load until the night is over."

#. Key:	DisplaySettingsUnavailable
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerController.cpp(3637)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerController.cpp(3637)
