msgstr "Save failed. Check your storage space and folder permissions."

#. Key:	LoadFailed
#. SourceLocation:	Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerController.cpp(3920)
#: Source/IndieGame/Player/IGPlayerController.cpp(3920)
